  "_about": "The Balls farm on the Mentor tab (a Colheita Feliz-style farming loop). Balls and the exchange rates come from #HusbandOutWorld (Vol 2: 50 pearls = 1 amethyst, 10 amethysts = 1 aquamarine, 10 aquamarines = 1 sapphire). The crops are invented for the game, not lore. 'cost' is what planting uses up, 'energy' is energy bars, 'seconds' is the growing time, and each outcome has a weight (chance relative to the others) and what it gives. Fertilizer: each shit put on a growing seed shifts weight from the bad outcomes (marked 'bad') to the good ones by 'fertilizer.shift' (up to 'fertilizer.max' shits per plant).",
